======================================================================================================================
K07-C -- THE UNIVERSAL LENSING CURVE, AND WHY THE LENSING RUNG CANNOT BE MADE MASS-TO-LIGHT-FREE
======================================================================================================================
  the surface-density unit of the theory: a_0/G = 1.4025 kg/m^2 = 671.4 Msun/pc^2 (canonical), 810.5 (alt)
  for comparison, the halo surface-density constant of item 5 is a_0/(2 pi G) = 106.9 Msun/pc^2 (canonical)

